# FORMAT: Surge RULE-SET
# 说明：Claude web, desktop and Claude Code share Anthropic domains; domains cannot distinguish these clients. Retains previously reviewed local core domains.
# 证据：https://code.claude.com/docs/en/network-config
# 证据：https://code.claude.com/docs/en/desktop

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,clau.de
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.app
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudemcpcontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudeusercontent.com
